  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
That's a really heavy feeling — when things keep going wrong at work, it's natural to wonder why. 🙏

In Master Lu's teachings, yes, our career experiences are connected to our karma. Difficulties at work — conflicts with bosses or colleagues, things not going smoothly, losing jobs — often reflect karmic causes from this life or past lives.

But here's the hopeful part: **karma can be changed.** That's the whole point of this practice.

Some common karmic causes for career difficulties:
- Past actions that harmed others (even unintentionally)
- Karmic creditors affecting your energy field
- Accumulated negative karma from past lives showing up now

**What you can do:**

📿 **Great Compassion Mantra (大悲咒)** — 7 times daily
Before reciting: *"Please Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva, bless me [your full name] with good health and strengthen my spiritual energy."*

📿 **Heart Sutra (心经)** — 7 times daily
Before reciting: *"Please Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva, bless me [your full name] with wisdom and remove my worries."*
⚠️ Not after 10pm

📿 **Cundi Mantra (准提神咒)** — 21 times daily
Before reciting: *"Please Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva, bless me [your full name] with fulfillment of my wishes — smooth career and work."*

📿 **Eighty-Eight Buddhas Great Repentance (礼佛大忏悔文)** — 1 time daily (start with just 1)
Before reciting: *"Please Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva, bless me [your full name] in repenting and eliminating my karmic obstacles."*
⚠️ Not after 10pm

Master Lu taught in *Metaphysics Q&A* that when we face hardships, rather than blaming external factors, we can use it as an opportunity to reflect — and through sincere recitation and repentance, karmic obstacles can truly be transformed.

Keep reciting consistently. Don't look for quick results — karma accumulated over lifetimes takes sincere, sustained effort. Guan Yin Bodhisattva will help when the time is right. 🙏

